Ma'am, could you quit writhing

1558
01:10:24,333 --> 01:10:26,067
on the coffee table?

1559
01:10:28,200 --> 01:10:31,000
Huh. Their bed technology
is light years behind

1560
01:10:31,033 --> 01:10:33,500
