technology.

1561
01:10:36,567 --> 01:10:38,667
Uh, excuse me, ma'am.
I don't mean to bother you.

1562
01:10:38,700 --> 01:10:42,467
Do you have any liv-a snaps
or perhaps a beggin' strip?

1563
01:10:42,500 --> 01:10:44,467
Think he's been backpacking
through europe?

1564
01:10:44,500 --> 01:10:46,000
[Mutters]

1565
01:10:47,700 --> 01:10:49,800
Uh, ma'am, I realize
you don't know me,

1566
01:10:49,833 --> 01:10:52,500
