to go walkies.

1567
01:10:55,167 --> 01:10:57,000
Oh, honey,
you look flush.

1568
01:10:57,033 --> 01:10:59,467
Let me feel your nose.

1569
01:10:59,500 --> 01:11:01,200
Oh. Hmm.

1570
01:11:01,233 --> 01:11:03,367
Oh, I bet you shed.
I shed.

1571
01:11:03,400 --> 01:11:05,533
Do you shed?

1572
