Tsk. Hang on.
I'm gonna get a two-wheeler.

1604
01:13:03,233 --> 01:13:06,967
Nurse! Nurse!

1605
01:13:07,000 --> 01:13:09,467
Okay, okay, okay.
Everything's cool.

1606
01:13:09,500 --> 01:13:11,367
