- [Sessom] Help.
- Sessom!

1614
01:13:31,367 --> 01:13:33,133
- Oh, father!
- He licked me all over!

1615
01:13:33,167 --> 01:13:34,700
Oh, father!

1616
01:13:34,733 --> 01:13:37,033
- What happened to him?
- I think it was the solarite.

1617
01:13:37,067 --> 01:13:39,167
- Are you all right?
- I...

1618
01:13:39,200 --> 01:13:42,133
- What happened?
- I don't know.

1619
01:13:42,167 --> 01:13:45,133
Was it the solarite?
Did you see him?

1620
01:13:45,167 --> 01:13:47,833
- It was terrible.
- [Chuckles]

1621
01:13:47,867 --> 01:13:51,667
I pushed down an old guy
for you, darling.

1622
01:13:51,700 --> 01:13:54,467
We'll build a split-level
with a doggie door.

1623
01:13:54,500 --> 01:13:58,333
I'll fetch the paper for you
every day.

1624
01:13:58,367 --> 01:14:00,467
Okay, I'm gonna go bark
