1646
01:14:48,733 --> 01:14:50,133
Okay, hang on.

1647
01:14:50,167 --> 01:14:51,800
On my way.
Be right there.

1648
01:14:51,833 --> 01:14:53,467
Hang on.
Just a minute.

1649
01:14:53,500 --> 01:14:55,200
Nice puppy.
[Nervous chuckle]
Good dog.

1650
